    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;An Adaptation By Tinged with Alison McCreesh’s signature blend of humour and humanity, Degrees of Separation is a story of the North and transformation. Following Alison’s personal journey from young adulthood to motherhood, the piece explores themes of connection, change, and anxiety told through the unique lens of a Northern life. The Tin Can Collective’s...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
