    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;This Lost Dog show reveals the real story of Romeo and Juliet. It turns out they didn’t die in a tragic misunderstanding; they grew up and lived happily ever after. Well, they lived.&nbsp; Now in their 40s and struggling with a mid-life crisis, they feel constantly mocked by their teenage selves and haunted by the...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
