        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A brand-new concert made just for NACC with a rising opera star from New York &amp; An ensemble of WORLD CLASS musicians! Kofi Hayford is a young, prize-winning Ghanaian-American bass, described as possessing an “impressive, “sonorous&quot;, and “stentorian bass voice”, also produces a distinct sound – easily identified for its unique timbre. With almost 40...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
