      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;THE RITE OF SPRING In Marie Chouinard’s work, The Rite of Spring occupies a special position. In choosing to re-examine this powerful hymn to life, she has created her first choreography based on a musical score. Igor Stravinsky’s The Rite of Spring explores a New World and marks the entry of dance into modernity. In...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
