        "@value": "Richard O&#8217;Brien&#8217;s &#8220;The Rocky Horror Show&#8221;"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Books, Music, Lyrics by Richard O\\'Brien Back by outrageous demand!&nbsp;Parcel of Rogues is bringing&nbsp;The Rocky Horror Show&nbsp;back to the NACC stage after last year’s&nbsp;debut.&nbsp; We\\'re still&nbsp;dripping with sequins, stilettos, and scandal, and this time we\\'re resurrecting The Rocky Horror Show&nbsp;for a Halloween weekend you’ll never forget (no matter how hard you try). ·&nbsp;&nbsp;October 30&nbsp;- Sneak...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
